rname{cos}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we simplify using the Pythagorean identity, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta .\n$$" 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282037 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282038 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282039 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282040 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282041 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1041 "selection" 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1104 #edb/ref 17592186282038 13194139534202 true] [17592186282036 1110 #uuid "cfb7cacd-4023-5e4c-8544-379376522bdd" 13194139534202 true] [17592186282037 1034 "2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " 13194139534202 true] [17592186282037 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534202 true] [17592186282037 1111 #uuid "0c310b27-dfc2-5fc4-b6bc-510f2bf63428" 13194139534202 true] [17592186282038 1034 "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " 13194139534202 true] [17592186282038 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534202 true] [17592186282038 1111 #uuid "84c29454-e450-5588-a5da-23b2c746ad69"